# Vue Router uses history mode, so a direct load or refresh on any route
# (e.g. /dashboard) has to fall through to index.html rather than 404 against
# a file that doesn't exist.
#
# NOTE: Render does NOT read this file - it's the Netlify/Cloudflare Pages
# convention, kept here for portability. On Render the same rule has to be
# added per-service under Redirects/Rewrites:
#   Source /*  ->  Destination /index.html  ->  Action: Rewrite
/*    /index.html   200
